{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o116a","title":"曹操拒绝追征辽东","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o116a-account","label":"正文","text":"有人劝乘胜征公孙康以擒二袁，曹操判断公孙康会自行杀二袁，不继续出兵。","evidence":["wudi-e-o116a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"决策","evidence":["wudi-e-o116a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"辽东","evidence":["wudi-e-o116a-q"]},"time":{"label":"破乌丸后","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o116a-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"破乌丸后","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,636,"O116a"],"order":258}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o116a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8e4c7f6cc2694c02bfab","layer":"original","quote":"初，辽东太守公孙康恃远不服〖18〗。及公破乌丸，或说公遂征之，尚兄弟可擒也。公曰：“吾方使康斩送尚、熙首，不烦兵矣！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":635,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
